exports[`lifecycle-only emails > conference failure and calendar fallback notices for the host 1`] = `
"Hi Julian Joseph,

We couldn't create a Google Meet link for your 30 Minute Virtual with Ana Lima on Tuesday, October 20, 2026. Your invitee sees "Web conferencing details to follow." until a link exists.

Event Type
30 Minute Virtual

Invitee
Ana Lima

Event Date/Time
10:00am - Tuesday, October 20, 2026 (Pacific Time - US & Canada)

What happened
Your calendar didn't create a Google Meet link for this meeting.

Open the meeting and choose Retry once the problem is fixed.

View meeting: http://localhost:3000/app/meetings?event=1

--
Powered by Kairos
You are receiving this email because you are a host of this event."
`;

